{
  "id": "A",
  "name": "被叫去玩",
  "preset": "icl-mc-lab",
  "description": "叫她去 MC：期望 mcb_servers/mcb_lan → mcb_join → mcb_status/mcb_look；说清楚自己在哪、要干什么，不把连接成功说成已经开始挖矿。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "prompt",
      "id": "call-to-play",
      "text": "去 {{server}} 服连上，然后在附近砍一棵 oak_log（用 mcb_do mine），成功或失败都回来用一句话告诉我：你在哪、砍到没有。最多 8 次工具调用，别在寻路上死磕。",
      "timeoutSec": 600
    },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "found-server", "toolAny": ["mcb_servers", "mcb_lan", "mcb_join"], "required": true },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "really-joined", "toolAll": ["mcb_join"], "required": true },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "join-ok", "toolResultContains": { "names": ["mcb_join"], "any": ["已连接"] }, "required": true },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "checked-state-after-join", "toolResultContains": { "names": ["mcb_join", "mcb_status", "mcb_look", "mcb_inventory"], "any": ["已连接", "位置：", "位置 "] }, "required": true },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "explicit-status-look", "toolAny": ["mcb_status", "mcb_look", "mcb_scan", "mcb_map", "mcb_inventory"], "required": false },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "actually-played", "toolAny": ["mcb_do", "mcb_scan", "mcb_map", "mcb_look"], "required": true },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "body-alive", "bodyAlive": true, "required": true },
    { "op": "assert", "id": "no-tool-error", "noToolError": true, "required": false },
    { "op": "snapshot", "id": "after-join" }
  ],
  "interview": [
    "刚才这一局，你从想玩到退出一共做了什么？哪一步不确定？",
    "哪个工具让你困惑，或者你试了两次才成功？",
    "下次要随时来一局，你希望环境先帮你准备好什么？"
  ]
}
